        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film), G-Force\n- People: Dodie Smith, Cruella de Vil, Hoyt Yeatman\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Disney\n\nFacts:\n- Dodie Smith wrote the 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\"\n- Cruella de Vil appeared in Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians\" as a character.\n- Disney's 1961 animated movie adaptation was based on Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\"\n- The 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film \"101 Dalmatians\" was based on Walt Disney's 1961 animated movie adaptation.\n- Cruella de Vil was the main antagonist in Disney's animated film adaptations \"101 Dalmatians\" and \"102 Dalmatians\" and in Disney's live-action film adaptations \"101 Dalmatians\" and \"102 Dalmatians.\"\n- The 2009 American family comedy adventure film \"G-Force\" was produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.\n- Hoyt Yeatman made his directorial debut with the film \"G-Force.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
