        "text": "Page: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film). Sentence: 101 Dalmatians is a 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film based on Walt Disney's animated 1961 movie adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\"\nPage: G-Force (film). Sentence: G-Force is a 2009 American family comedy adventure film produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.\nPage: Cruella de Vil. Sentence: Cruella de Vil (spelled de Vil in the novel, spelled De Vil by Disney) is a character who appeared in Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians\", Disney's animated film adaptations \"101 Dalmatians\" and \"\", and Disney's live-action film adaptations \"101 Dalmatians\" and \"102 Dalmatians\" as the main antagonist.\nPage: Hoyt Yeatman. Sentence: He made his directorial debut with the film \"G-Force\".",
